        "media_position": "right",
        "media_width": "11",
        "subheading": "<p><strong>Stone Shapes</strong></p>",
        "title": "<p>Form, Light & Expression</p>",
        "description": "<p>The shape of a gemstone is one of the most defining elements of a piece.<br/>It influences not only how a stone looks, but how it interacts with light, how it sits on the hand, and how it feels to wear. Each shape carries its own visual language - some soft and organic, others structured and precise.<br/>We see shape as an extension of personal expression - a balance between proportion, character and intention.</p>",
        "content_alignment": "middleLeft",
        "colour_style": "dark",
        "button_1_text": "",
        "button_1_link": "",
        "button_style": "underline"
      }
    },
